<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's IRSA proposes cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Argentina's IRSA proposes cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine real state firm IRSA Inversiones y Representaciones S.A. said Tuesday its board will propose to shareholders a cash dividend of between $0.06 and $0.11 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is equivalent to six to 11 percent of the share's nominal value, IRSA told the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Additional details were immediately unavailable.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
